  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「よいしょ、っと♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「とりあえず、まりあはここに寝かせとけばいいでしょ。たぶん、そのうち目ぇ覚ますわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あたしは、門限あるからもう帰るけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「誰もいないと思って、まりあに変なことしたら頸動脈を噛みちぎってやるから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「よぉく気をつけることね転校生っ、ふんふんふ～んだ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「そんじゃね、ばいばい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「……あっ、そうだ。これ小銭ね、お昼ご飯の代金。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんた、何食わぬ顔であたしのぶんも支払ってたでしょ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ちゃんと返したから、これで貸し借りなしだからねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんたさ～……。何度も言うようだけど、もっと恩着せがましくしなさいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「神さまとちがって、みんな他人が善行を積んでも見てやしないのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ふつうは誰も、なかなか気づいてくれないんだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「良いことをしたなら、胸を張って威張りなさいよ。その権利があんのよ、あんたにはさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんた、神さまでも聖人君子でもないんでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ふつうの、男の子なんだから。格好つけて、女の子にでも『どうだ！』って誇ればいいのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「そしたら、あんたに惚れちゃう奇特なやつもでてくるかもねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「……ちょっとだけ、優しくしてくれて嬉しかった。ありがとね、転校生」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「まりあのこと、よろしくね。そいつ、何にも知らない間抜けだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「天然ボケで付きあってると疲れるけど、ほんと腹が立つぐらい良い子だからさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「そいつも、気がつくと他人のお世話してるの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「献身的に、看病したりさ。寄り添って、手ぇ握ってくれてたりさ……。嬉しそうに、馬鹿みたいにさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「報われるべきよ。あんたも、まりあも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「お似合いよ、あんたたち。そんだけ、いちおう言っとく」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「じゃあね、今度こそばいばいっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sleepy",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「……んん、梅ちゃん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「梅ちゃんの声が、聞こえた気がします。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「梅ちゃんの声はキンキン響いて脳に刺さります、目覚まし時計として売りだすべきではと思うのですけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ふあぁふ♪　おや、おはようございます転校生さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「はて、なぜ転校生さんが？　それに、わたくしのこの服装は……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「あぁ、寝惚けております。なぜでしょう、いつの間にか自宅におりますね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「瞬間移動したのでしょうか、そういう漫画を読みました。主の奇跡ですね、アーメン……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「いえ。転校生さんが、運んでくださったのですよね。すみません、ご迷惑をおかけして……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「いつもお世話になっていますね、感謝しております♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ふふ。転校生さんは、敬虔な信徒たらんとばかりしていた、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくしの目の前に突如として迷いこんでこられた救世主です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくしはいつも心がかき乱され、どう対応したらいいかもわからず……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「むしろ転校生さんは、わたくしを惑わしにきた悪魔のようです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「あなたは、不可思議なひと。救世主のようであり、悪魔のようであり……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「けれどやはり、ふつうの男性のようでもあって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「戸惑っております。けれど、あなたのことがもっと知りたいです。そんな強い衝動があります、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「これが罪深い感情でないことを祈っております」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくしは、自分の気持ちを押しつけてばかりで……。あなたのことを、まだほとんど知りません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「互いに知りたいと望み、与えあうことが恋愛なのだと、みつるちゃんに教わりました。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「独り善がりではいけませんね、そこが信仰との差異です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「すべてを投げだし、おおいなる主の御心のままに……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ただ祈り、徳を積み、原罪を贖う。孤独に淡々と、一方的に尽くすのみ。天国での、救済を期待して」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「それが信仰でしょう、けれど恋は互いに与えあうべきものです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「愛しあい、慈しみあい、慰めあう。婚姻の際に、わたくしたちは神の前でそう誓う。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「そう、互いに与えあうのですね……。なので、どうかわたくしにも与えてください」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「些細なことでも、いいのです。このまま、すぐに帰ってしまうのでは寂しいです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「お茶を用意します、お食事も如何でしょう。たくさん、転校生さんとお話がしたいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「生まれ故郷はどこですか？　好きな食べ物は？　休日はどのようにお過ごしでしょう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「好みの、女性のタイプは……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「何でも、教えてくださいまし。あなたのことなら、どんなことでも知りたいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「与えてください。痛みでも憎しみでもいい、鬱陶しいと払いのけられるだけでもいい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「あなたからの、行為と、できれば好意がほしいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「あなたは無口なので、話の『きっかけ』をつくってくれませんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくしも、懺悔を聞くように、ただ待っているばかりです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「これでは、何も変わりません。変えたいと思います、わずかでも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「なので、わたくしから語りましょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/evolved/1135"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「そういえば、きちんとお伝えしていませんでしたね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「今さらですが、告白しましょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
